{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismissSearch"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV","text":"DismissSearchAction"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this environment value to get the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction"},{"type":"text","text":" instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the current "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment"},{"type":"text","text":". Then call the instance to dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current search interaction. You call the instance directly because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it defines a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()"},{"type":"text","text":" method that Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls when you call the instance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you dismiss search, OpenSwiftUI:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sets ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues\/isSearching"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Clears any text from the search field.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes focus from the search field."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Calling this instance has no effect if the user isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"interacting with a search field.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this action to dismiss a search operation based on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another user interaction. For example, consider a searchable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view with a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Button"},{"text":" that presents more information about the first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matching item from a collection:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @State private var text = \"\"","","    var body: some View {","        NavigationView {","            SearchResults(searchText: text)","                .searchable(text: $text)","        }","    }","}","","private struct SearchResults: View {","    let searchText: String","","    let items = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]","    var filteredItems: [String] { items.filter { $0 == searchText.lowercased() } }","","    @State private var isPresented = false","","    var body: some View {","        if let item = filteredItems.first {","            Button(\"Details about \\(item)\") {","                isPresented = true","            }","            .sheet(isPresented: $isPresented) {","                NavigationView {","                    DetailView(item: item)","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The button becomes visible only after the user enters search text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that produces a match. When the user taps the button, OpenSwiftUI shows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sheet that provides more information about the item, including"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an Add button for adding the item to a stored list of items:"}]},{"code":["private struct DetailView: View {","    let item: String","","    @Environment(\\.dismiss) private var dismiss","    @Environment(\\.dismissSearch) private var dismissSearch","","    var body: some View {","        Text(\"Information about \\(item).\")","            .toolbar {","                Button(\"Add\") {","                    \/\/ Store the item here...","","                    dismiss()","                    dismissSearch()","                }","            }","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user can dismiss the sheet by dragging it down, effectively"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"canceling the operation, leaving the in-progress search interaction"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intact. Alternatively, the user can tap the Add button to store the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"item. Because the user is likely to be done with both the detail view"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the search interaction at this point, the button’s closure also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"uses the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" property to dismiss the sheet,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the "},{"code":"dismissSearch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property to reset the search field."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismissSearch","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"An action that ends the current search interaction.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismisssearch"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI17EnvironmentValuesV13dismissSearchAA07DismissG6ActionVvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismissSearch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissSearchAction","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV"}],"title":"dismissSearch","symbolKind":"property","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentValues"}],"title":"EnvironmentValues","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentValues"}],"abstract":[{"text":"OpenSwiftUI exposes a collection of values to your app’s views in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"EnvironmentValues","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" structure. To read a value from the structure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declare a property using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","isActive":true},{"text":" property wrapper and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specify the value’s key path. For example, you can read the current locale:","type":"text"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissSearchAction/callAsFunction()":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismisssearchaction\/callasfunction()","abstract":[{"text":"Dismisses the current search operation, if any.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction\/callAsFunction()","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"callAsFunction"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"title":"callAsFunction()"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Environment":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Environment"}],"title":"Environment","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environment","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Environment","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Environment","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property wrapper that reads a value from a view’s environment."}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/dismissSearch":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismissSearch","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dismissSearch"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19DismissSearchActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DismissSearchAction"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that ends the current search interaction."}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismisssearch","title":"dismissSearch","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/EnvironmentValues/dismiss":{"title":"dismiss","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/environmentvalues\/dismiss","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EnvironmentValues\/dismiss","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dismiss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13DismissActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An action that dismisses the current presentation."}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/DismissSearchAction":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/dismisssearchaction","abstract":[{"text":"An action that can end a search interaction.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissSearchAction","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DismissSearchAction"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DismissSearchAction","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DismissSearchAction"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]}}}